      "voiceName": "Stephen A. Smith",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "\ud83d\ude09\ud83d\ude09\ud83d\ude09\n\n\nShae Cornette (@shaepeppler)\n\nLooking forward to having a front row seat to this! First Take takes LA on Friday\u2026 I\u2019ll bring my A game.\n\n\n\n\u2014 https://nitter.net/shaepeppler/status/2051459016832754093#m",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/stephenasmith/status/2051496352862159281",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-05T02:57:00+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "stephen-a-smith",
      "voiceName": "Stephen A. Smith",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "He was absolutely right: my man @Mr_Camron told the world I promised to bring him on @FirstTake since last year. Albeit eventually, I am a man of my word. He\u2019ll be on tomorrow morning! And he won\u2019t be the last. This is just the beginning. Looking forward to bringing a few folks on. Stay Tuned! Here we come!",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/stephenasmith/status/2051477701546881523",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-05T01:42:53+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "stephen-a-smith",
      "voiceName": "Stephen A. Smith",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "I\u2019m LIVE on @MadDogRadio and I\u2019m calling it EXACTLY how I see it. No Filter. No Script. Just Facts. \n\nBring the energy and call in with your BEST take! I want PASSION. I want FACTS.\n\n\ud83d\udcfb: sxm.app.link/MadDogRadio",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/stephenasmith/status/2051346240911163744",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-04T17:00:30+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "stephen-a-smith",
      "voiceName": "Stephen A. Smith",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Win, lose or draw, this brother @Pp_doesit - Paolo Banchero \u2014 is something special. The question ain\u2019t about whether he\u2019ll show up. It\u2019s about whether or not someone on @OrlandoMagic will show up to support him. Because he\u2019s gonna need it against Cade, the @DetroitPistons and that magnificent, rabid crowd. We shall see. Game living up to Game 7 expectations!",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/stephenasmith/status/2051038012587597832",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-03T20:35:43+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "stephen-a-smith",
      "voiceName": "Stephen A. Smith",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Props to the @sixers. Big-time win. But I\u2019d don\u2019t understand for the life of me how the @celtics spent 6-straight possessions launching 3\u2019s \u2014 including 3 from @FCHWPO  \u2014 in the last 2 min of a 1-point game. How? Why? Nobody goes to the hole? Tries to draw a foul? Get to the free throw line? Oh Well. The @sixers deserve this moment. The. Monday arrives, as to my @nyknicks.#LetsGo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/stephenasmith/status/2050761089693233160",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-03T02:15:19+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "stephen-a-smith",
      "voiceName": "Stephen A. Smith",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "What a game between the @sixers vs @celtics. What a game. @JoelEmbiid is just special. So is @TyreseMaxey. But somehow the @celtics have come back from nearly 20 down and have pulled to within one with a little more than 5 min left. Very few things in life better than a Game 7",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/stephenasmith/status/2050753886991139089",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-03T01:46:42+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "stephen-a-smith",
      "voiceName": "Stephen A. Smith",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Funny as hell\u2026\u2026to this very day\n instagram.com/reel/DXumX9kAR\u2026",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/stephenasmith/status/2050439787249803644",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-02T04:58:35+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "stephen-a-smith",
      "voiceName": "Stephen A. Smith",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "I am coming in HOT today! I want to hear from you! You know the number to call, but remember HAVE YOUR BEST TAKE READY! @MadDogRadio \n\n\ud83c\udfa7: sxm.app.link/SASonSXM",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/stephenasmith/status/2050263878068543591",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-01T17:19:35+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
